ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_The_Wavelength_Sweet_Spots_0_Row_0 ex:Why "Lignin is a potent UV blocker. It absorbs this energy and converts it to heat (destroying your Bragg resonance)." .
