ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_The_Wavelength_Sweet_Spots_0_Row_1 ex:Why "Lignin is brownish; it absorbs green light. This causes signal loss and \"thermal blooming\" (heating the mirror during use)." .
