ex:Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_The_Verdict_for_3DRAM ex:reason_2_good_enough_is_perfect "You don't need the 30dB purity of MPLC (used for fiber optics). You are designing the transmitter and receiver yourself. You can simply choose mode sizes (e.g., Mode 1 and Mode 5) that have huge radial differences, making the \"Medium Purity\" of the radial detector irrelevant." .
