ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_1_Row_0 ex:Pros "Easy to fab, high refractive index." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_1_Row_0 ex:Cons "Absorbs visible light (opaque)." .
