ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Spectrum "UV / Blue" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Wavelength "< 450 nm" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Feasibility "Impossible" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Why "Lignin is a potent UV blocker. It absorbs this energy and converts it to heat (destroying your Bragg resonance)." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_5_Row_1 .
