ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Feature "Adhesion" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Old_Method_Separate_Steps "Use glue/primer to stick rGO to substrate." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Revised_Synergistic_Method "H-Bonding:Rely on natural chemical match between CNC & GO." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Benefit "Eliminates 1 chemical step; thinner device." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
