ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Old_Method_Separate_Steps "Risk of burning substrate." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Revised_Synergistic_Method "Spectral Gating:Use 780nm laser which CNC \"ignores.\"" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Benefit "Prevents damage to the Bragg Mirror." .
