ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_2 ex:Old_Method_Separate_Steps "High-power pulse (violent reduction)." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_2 ex:Revised_Synergistic_Method "CW Scanning:Low-power, slow scan (gentle reduction)." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_2 ex:Benefit "Prevents gas buildup/delamination." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
