ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_3 ex:Revised_Synergistic_Method "Water Only:Both CNC and GO use water." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_9_Row_3 ex:Benefit "Explosion-prooffactory; lower HVAC costs." .
