ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_0 ex:The_Solution "Supply chain is stable." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
