ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_1 ex:Feature "Fabrication" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_1 ex:Feasibility_Score "Medium-High" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_1 ex:The_Bottleneck "\"Perfect Pitch\" humidity control is slow (hours)." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_1 ex:The_Solution "UseUV-Curable crosslinkersto \"freeze\" the pitch instantly after coating, removing the long drying tunnel." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 ex:Feature "Durability" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 ex:Feasibility_Score "Low (Risk)" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 ex:The_Bottleneck "CNC swells with humidity; rGO oxidizes." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_2 ex:The_Solution "Encapsulation is mandatory.A thin layer of hydrophobic polymer (like PDMS or a flexible Vitrimer) is required to seal it." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_3 .
