ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_3 ex:Feasibility_Score "Medium" .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_3 ex:The_Bottleneck "rGO is less conductive than Gold/Copper." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_10_Row_3 ex:The_Solution "Use \"Interdigitated Electrodes\" (the comb shape) to minimize the distance electrons must travel." .
