ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_0 ex:MPLC_Multi_Plane_Light_Conversion "Diffractive Neural Net.5-7 layers of printed phase plates perform a complex mathematical transform." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_0 ex:Hybrid_Y_Junction_Radial "Physical Geometry.Uses centrifugal force (OAM) to route beams like marbles in a track." .
