ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_1 ex:MPLC_Multi_Plane_Light_Conversion "Lateral Spots.Converts modes into Gaussian dots at different(x,y)locations." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_1 ex:Hybrid_Y_Junction_Radial "Radial Zones.Sorts modes into Concentric Rings and Left/Right branches." .
