ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_2 ex:MPLC_Multi_Plane_Light_Conversion "Ultra-High (>30 dB).Can separate very similar modes perfectly." .
ex:Table_Speckle_Metamaterials_and_Fast_Sensing_File_Summary_29_Row_2 ex:Hybrid_Y_Junction_Radial "Medium (15-20 dB).\"Mode +1\" might overlap slightly with \"Mode +2\" if the rings are too close." .
