ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Photons_Particle_Nature_0_Row_1 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Very High: Megabits to Gigabits per second (Mbps - Gbps).Limited by the speed of the photodetector and analog-to-digital converter." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Photons_Particle_Nature_0_Row_1 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Extremely Low.The state of the lamps changes over seconds. Randomness is extracted by hashing images of the lamps, not from the lamps directly." .
