ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Photons_Particle_Nature_0_Row_2 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Extremely High.The entire device can be built on a tiny chip and run onmilliwatts (mW)of power." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Photons_Particle_Nature_0_Row_2 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Extremely Low.Each lamp requires a ~40W incandescent bulb for heat. A wall of them consumeskilowatts (kW)." .
