ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Photons_Particle_Nature_0_Row_3 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Very High.Requires dozens of lamps, cameras, a dedicated room, and significant infrastructure." .
