ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_The_Left_Plot ex:what_the_nic_digitizes "The NIC's photodiode integrates (sums up) the total brightness across this entire 2D area at a specific instant in time. As the pattern boils, that total brightness sum fluctuates chaotically, producing your raw random bits." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_The_Left_Plot ex:what_the_nic_digitizes "The NIC's photodiode integrates (sums up) the total brightness across this entire 2D area at a specific instant in time. As the pattern boils, that total brightness sum fluctuates chaotically, producing your raw random bits." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
