ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Safety a iof:PlannedProcess ;
    rdfs:label "Protecting the Router" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Safety ex:critical "Never fire your lasers directly into your home router's SFP+ port without the WDM filter in place. Standard routers are not expecting 1310nm light on a 1550nm port. The WDM filter acts as a \"One-Way Mirror,\" ensuring your entropy stays on your mining rig and your internet stays on your router." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Safety ex:critical "Never fire your lasers directly into your home router's SFP+ port without the WDM filter in place. Standard routers are not expecting 1310nm light on a 1550nm port. The WDM filter acts as a \"One-Way Mirror,\" ensuring your entropy stays on your mining rig and your internet stays on your router." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
