ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection a iof:PlannedProcess ;
    rdfs:label "1\\. How Predictive Monitoring Improves Failure Detection" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:pattern_correlation "Instead of looking at temperature alone, the Tiny-ML model correlates temperature spikes with a gradual increase in PCIe latency and bit-variance. Individually, these are \"normal,\" but together, they signal a failing SFP+ transceiver." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:pattern_correlation "Instead of looking at temperature alone, the Tiny-ML model correlates temperature spikes with a gradual increase in PCIe latency and bit-variance. Individually, these are \"normal,\" but together, they signal a failing SFP+ transceiver." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:drift_velocity "The system calculates the _rate of change_ (first derivative) of Shannon entropy. If the drift is accelerating, the model predicts a \"cliff\" failure long before the hard threshold is hit." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:drift_velocity "The system calculates the _rate of change_ (first derivative) of Shannon entropy. If the drift is accelerating, the model predicts a \"cliff\" failure long before the hard threshold is hit." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:noise_signature_analysis "A laser failing due to thermal stress has a different \"spectral signature\" than one affected by simple vibration. Predictive models can filter out environmental noise to prevent false security interlocks." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_How_Predictive_Monitoring_Improves_Failure_Detection ex:noise_signature_analysis "A laser failing due to thermal stress has a different \"spectral signature\" than one affected by simple vibration. Predictive models can filter out environmental noise to prevent false security interlocks." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
