    rdfs:label "4\\. Why \"Off by Default\" is Critical" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Why_Off_by_Default_is_Critical ex:regulatory_compliance "Many cryptographic standards forbid unencrypted traffic on shared L2 segments. By keeping Shadow Links off, the rig remains compliant by default." .
<< ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Why_Off_by_Default_is_Critical ex:regulatory_compliance "Many cryptographic standards forbid unencrypted traffic on shared L2 segments. By keeping Shadow Links off, the rig remains compliant by default." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_Why_Off_by_Default_is_Critical ex:intentional_performance "Shadow Links are a performance optimization for controlled environments. Making them optional ensures that the user is aware of the security trade-off (bypassing the VPN for a raw MACsec-only link)." .
