ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_0 .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_0 ex:Feature "Source of Entropy" .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_0 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Quantum shot noise and chaotic phase drift." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_0 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Macroscopic, chaotic fluid dynamics (turbulent flow of wax)." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_1 .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_1 ex:Feature "Bitrate" .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_1 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Very High: Megabits to Gigabits per second (Mbps - Gbps).Limited by the speed of the photodetector and analog-to-digital converter." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_1 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Extremely Low.The state of the lamps changes over seconds. Randomness is extracted by hashing images of the lamps, not from the lamps directly." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_2 ex:Feature "Energy Efficiency" .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_2 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Extremely High.The entire device can be built on a tiny chip and run onmilliwatts (mW)of power." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_2 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Extremely Low.Each lamp requires a ~40W incandescent bulb for heat. A wall of them consumeskilowatts (kW)." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_3 .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_3 ex:Feature "Cost & Size" .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_3 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Very Low.Can be implemented with pennies' worth of components on a silicon chip smaller than a fingernail." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_3 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Very High.Requires dozens of lamps, cameras, a dedicated room, and significant infrastructure." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_4 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_4 .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_4 ex:Feature "Practicality" .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_4 ex:LED_Interference_TRNG "Highly practical for integration into everything from servers to microcontrollers and IoT devices." .
ex:Table_Red_and_Blue_Laser_Beam_Mixing_File_Summary_0_Row_4 ex:Lava_Lamp_TRNG_Wall_of_Entropy "Primarily a visually compelling, public-facing demonstration of randomness. It's not a practical design for widespread use." .
