ex:CNF_Processing_PFP_Confusion_Clarified_The_Superelastic_Advantage a iof:PlannedProcess ;
    rdfs:label "1\\. The \"Superelastic\" Advantage" .
ex:CNF_Processing_PFP_Confusion_Clarified_The_Superelastic_Advantage ex:cnf_problem "When standard CNF aerogels dry (especially via ice-templating), the nanofibers pack into dense, sheet-like walls (like a honeycomb). When you crush this, the walls buckle and crack permanently." .
