ex:CNF_Processing_PFP_Confusion_Clarified_Waste_Hemp_Noil_vs_HydroCNF ex:hydrophobicity "The \"Self-cleaning\" paper you linked notes that hemp aerogels can be easily modified to be superhydrophobic (water-repelling). Because hemp fibers naturally contain more lignin (unless heavily bleached) than high-purity CNF, they may be easier to compatibilize with oil-based treatments, though the \"Self-cleaning\" paper still used a chemical coating (silane/polysiloxane) to achieve this." .
<< ex:CNF_Processing_PFP_Confusion_Clarified_Waste_Hemp_Noil_vs_HydroCNF ex:hydrophobicity "The \"Self-cleaning\" paper you linked notes that hemp aerogels can be easily modified to be superhydrophobic (water-repelling). Because hemp fibers naturally contain more lignin (unless heavily bleached) than high-purity CNF, they may be easier to compatibilize with oil-based treatments, though the \"Self-cleaning\" paper still used a chemical coating (silane/polysiloxane) to achieve this." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
