ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Integration ex:for_fjh "The Bast Bank charges slowly from the grid (low power) and discharges instantly into the cable (massive power). This prevents your factory from dimming the neighborhood lights every time you \"flash\" a cable." .
