ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Intellectual_Property_Claims ex:lignolux_008_method_for_induction_welding_of_hybrid_metalceramic_conductors "A field-joining method for hybrid cermet cables wherein an induction coil simultaneously melts the aluminum alloy core and softens the vitrimer-cermet skin, allowing the phases to intermix and fuse into a mechanically continuous, electrically conductive joint with no contact resistance or galvanic corrosion potential." .
