    rdfs:label "**Materials Processing & Synthesis**" .
ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_011_fjhassisted_solubility_enhancement_of_rare_earth_elements "A method for extracting critical minerals from bauxite residue (red mud), comprising the rapid resistive heating (Flash Joule Heating) of the dry residue to induce thermal shock and phase separation, thereby rendering rare earth oxides (specifically Scandium and Yttrium) water-soluble or acid-leachable, enabling low-energy hydrometallurgical extraction without high-pressure digestion." .
<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_011_fjhassisted_solubility_enhancement_of_rare_earth_elements "A method for extracting critical minerals from bauxite residue (red mud), comprising the rapid resistive heating (Flash Joule Heating) of the dry residue to induce thermal shock and phase separation, thereby rendering rare earth oxides (specifically Scandium and Yttrium) water-soluble or acid-leachable, enabling low-energy hydrometallurgical extraction without high-pressure digestion." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_012_synthesis_of_highsaturation_iron_nitride_magnets_from_industrial_waste "A process for manufacturing permanent magnetic materials ( $Fe_{16}N_{2}$ ) from bauxite residue, comprising the hydrogen plasma reduction of iron oxides within the residue to form pure iron nodules, followed by gas-phase nitriding and magnetic field-assisted sintering, yielding rare-earth-free gap magnets for use in electric motor rotors or magnetic alignment arrays." .
<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_012_synthesis_of_highsaturation_iron_nitride_magnets_from_industrial_waste "A process for manufacturing permanent magnetic materials ( $Fe_{16}N_{2}$ ) from bauxite residue, comprising the hydrogen plasma reduction of iron oxides within the residue to form pure iron nodules, followed by gas-phase nitriding and magnetic field-assisted sintering, yielding rare-earth-free gap magnets for use in electric motor rotors or magnetic alignment arrays." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_013_structural_energy_storage_housings_via_carbonized_bast_fibers "A multifunctional structural composite acting simultaneously as an equipment housing and an electrical energy buffer (supercapacitor), comprising rigid electrodes formed from pyrolyzed bast fibers (hemp/flax) decorated with hydrothermal carbon nanospheres, enabling the device casing to deliver high-current pulses for induction or flash heating processes while bearing mechanical load." .
<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_Materials_Processing_Synthesis ex:lignolux_013_structural_energy_storage_housings_via_carbonized_bast_fibers "A multifunctional structural composite acting simultaneously as an equipment housing and an electrical energy buffer (supercapacitor), comprising rigid electrodes formed from pyrolyzed bast fibers (hemp/flax) decorated with hydrothermal carbon nanospheres, enabling the device casing to deliver high-current pulses for induction or flash heating processes while bearing mechanical load." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
