    rdfs:label "New IP Claim for Fusion" .
ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_New_IP_Claim_for_Fusion ex:lignolux_017_integrated_htscomposite_conductor_from_bauxite_residue "A high-field superconducting cable architecture comprising a structural substrate of scandium-aluminum alloy, a diffusion barrier of flash-induced titanium carbide, and a superconducting layer of Yttrium-Barium-Copper-Oxide (YBCO), wherein the Scandium, Aluminum, Titanium, and Yttrium components are all chemically partitioned from a single bauxite residue feedstock stream, creating a mechanically robust, supply-chain-sovereign magnet conductor." .
<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_New_IP_Claim_for_Fusion ex:lignolux_017_integrated_htscomposite_conductor_from_bauxite_residue "A high-field superconducting cable architecture comprising a structural substrate of scandium-aluminum alloy, a diffusion barrier of flash-induced titanium carbide, and a superconducting layer of Yttrium-Barium-Copper-Oxide (YBCO), wherein the Scandium, Aluminum, Titanium, and Yttrium components are all chemically partitioned from a single bauxite residue feedstock stream, creating a mechanically robust, supply-chain-sovereign magnet conductor." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
