ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_II_Revised_Supercapacitor_Claims_Generic_Structural ex:lignolux_021_bast_fibernanosphere_electrochemical_composite_the_generic_cell "A supercapacitor electrode material comprising a pyrolyzed lignocellulosic bast fiber scaffold (e.g., hemp or flax) featuring natural micro-tubular porosity, decorated with hydrothermally synthesized carbon nanospheres, configured to provide high surface area and low equivalent series resistance (ESR) for high-power pulse discharge applications independent of form factor. _(Note: This covers the chemistry, whether it's a AAA battery, a pouch cell, or a brick.)_" .
