ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_II_Conductor_Cable_Architecture_The_Wire_Claims ex:lignolux_006_structure_of_a_hybrid_aluminumscandiumcarbon_cable "A composite electrical cable comprising a central load-bearing core of aluminum-scandium alloy derived from bauxite residue, a chemically bonded interface layer of flash-induced graphene-cermet, and an outer insulating jacket of magnetically aligned vertical graphene or boron nitride nanotubes embedded in a lignin-vitrimer matrix." .
<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_II_Conductor_Cable_Architecture_The_Wire_Claims ex:lignolux_006_structure_of_a_hybrid_aluminumscandiumcarbon_cable "A composite electrical cable comprising a central load-bearing core of aluminum-scandium alloy derived from bauxite residue, a chemically bonded interface layer of flash-induced graphene-cermet, and an outer insulating jacket of magnetically aligned vertical graphene or boron nitride nanotubes embedded in a lignin-vitrimer matrix." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
