<< ex:Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_II_Conductor_Cable_Architecture_The_Wire_Claims ex:lignolux_007_phasechange_sweating_cable_insulation "A thermal management system comprising a porous lignin-derived aerogel jacket impregnated with a phase-change material (PCM), configured to absorb transient thermal spikes via latent heat fusion." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
