ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_0 ex:Why "High Frequency.The motor is constantly switching frequencies. You need a robust skin to handle the \"AC Ripple\" and heat." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_1 .
