ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_1 ex:Skin_Thickness_Cermet "Thin" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_1 ex:Why "Mechanical Strength.The Al-Sc core is there to prevent the cable from sagging between towers (Scandium strength). The skin is just for corrosion protection." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Cables_Method_vs_Application_File_Summary_14_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
