ex:Rare_Earth_Free_Permanent_Magnet_Alternatives_L1_Tetrataenite_FeNi_The_Cosmic_Magnet ex:why_its_an_alternative "It relies on abundant nickel and iron rather than rare earths or complex nitrogenation processes. It offers a \"Goldilocks\" balance of cost and performance." .
