ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_Why_sCO2sN2_is_Superior_for_Helion a iof:PlannedProcess ;
    rdfs:label "2\\. Why sCO2/sN2 is Superior for Helion" .
ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_Why_sCO2sN2_is_Superior_for_Helion ex:immediate_reenergization "Because sCO2 and sN2 are bone-dry and non-conductive, you can vent the vault, fix the faulty component, and restart the machine almost immediately. There is no water damage or \"gunk\" to clean off the 720 miles of CNT cables." .
<< ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_Why_sCO2sN2_is_Superior_for_Helion ex:immediate_reenergization "Because sCO2 and sN2 are bone-dry and non-conductive, you can vent the vault, fix the faulty component, and restart the machine almost immediately. There is no water damage or \"gunk\" to clean off the 720 miles of CNT cables." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_Why_sCO2sN2_is_Superior_for_Helion ex:pressureassisted_penetration "Because these fluids are stored in a supercritical state, they expand at supersonic speeds when vented. This ensures the suppressant reaches the deep, \"tight\" spaces inside the capacitor pallets and between the magnetic windings that a standard sprinkler could never reach." .
