ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_Hidden_Complexity_of_Copper a iof:PlannedProcess ;
    rdfs:label "1\\. The \"Hidden Complexity\" of Copper" .
ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_Hidden_Complexity_of_Copper ex:the_weightcomplexity_spiral "As we calculated, 720 miles of copper weigh ~750 tons. To support that weight, Helion must build massive, reinforced steel and concrete structures. This creates a \"heavy\" plant that is difficult to cool and maintain." .
<< ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_Hidden_Complexity_of_Copper ex:the_weightcomplexity_spiral "As we calculated, 720 miles of copper weigh ~750 tons. To support that weight, Helion must build massive, reinforced steel and concrete structures. This creates a \"heavy\" plant that is difficult to cool and maintain." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
