ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_Hidden_Complexity_of_Copper ex:the_skin_effect_tax "Because copper resists high-frequency pulses (the skin effect), it generates massive internal heat _inside_ the wire. To manage this, Helion needs high-flow water-cooling systems with pumps, deionizers, and leak-sensitive plumbing throughout the high-voltage vault." .
