ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_DoubleLayer_Efficiency ex:active_surface_area "Carbon nanospheres, especially those derived from hydrothermal carbonization of biomass like hemp bast, can reach surface areas exceeding 2,000 m²/g." .
<< ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_DoubleLayer_Efficiency ex:active_surface_area "Carbon nanospheres, especially those derived from hydrothermal carbonization of biomass like hemp bast, can reach surface areas exceeding 2,000 m²/g." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
    ex:extractionSource "MyST-Parser-Regex" .
ex:Lignolux_Enhances_Fusion_Production_Design_The_DoubleLayer_Efficiency ex:power_density "This massive surface area, combined with the spherical geometry, allows the supercapacitor to achieve power densities upward of 10–50 kW/kg. This is exactly what is required to drive the high-intensity magnetic pulses that compress the fusion plasma." .
