ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_The_Vantablack_Shielding_Design ex:how_it_works "VACNTs are some of the most \"black\" materials ever created. Because the nanotubes are vertically aligned and spaced perfectly, they act as a \"photon trap.\" When a stray photon enters the forest, it bounces between the tubes until it is absorbed as heat rather than reflecting onto the qubit." .
