ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_The_siZZle_Gate_in_a_Star_Topology ex:how_it_works "The Lignin-Vitrimer substrate acts as a lossy dielectric that absorbs the specific microwave frequencies used to \"cloak\" the spokes. Because the \"Ancilla Hub\" is the only thing you want to talk to, the Lignin matrix allows you to \"drown out\" the idle spokes with a broadband Stark tone that doesn't cause the chip to overheat (due to Lignin's unique thermal properties)." .
<< ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_The_siZZle_Gate_in_a_Star_Topology ex:how_it_works "The Lignin-Vitrimer substrate acts as a lossy dielectric that absorbs the specific microwave frequencies used to \"cloak\" the spokes. Because the \"Ancilla Hub\" is the only thing you want to talk to, the Lignin matrix allows you to \"drown out\" the idle spokes with a broadband Stark tone that doesn't cause the chip to overheat (due to Lignin's unique thermal properties)." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
