ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_Technical_Risks_Mitigations_0_Row_3 ex:Impact "Misaligned \"spokes\" in the Star Topology causing gate errors." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_Technical_Risks_Mitigations_0_Row_3 ex:Mitigation_Strategy "Self-Aligning Grooves:Use Laser Compression Shock (LCS) to create microscopic channels in the vitrimer that \"guide\" the CNTs into position during the initial ink deposition phase." .
