ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_NanoEncapsulation_Technology_The_Covalent_Cage ex:the_mechanism "At  $250^{\\circ }C$ , the Phytic Acid triggers a dehydration reaction in the Lignin. This transforms the matrix into a solid, stony char" .
<< ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_NanoEncapsulation_Technology_The_Covalent_Cage ex:the_mechanism "At  $250^{\\circ }C$ , the Phytic Acid triggers a dehydration reaction in the Lignin. This transforms the matrix into a solid, stony char" >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
