    rdfs:label "$$32M$  is generated from Isotope Sales, LCS-Micro-Optics, and Smart-Wing pilots?**\n\n---\n\nYou asked:\n----------\n\nYes\n\n---\n\nGemini Replied:\n---------------\n\nThis **Year-1 Revenue Roadmap** marks the transition of the A2Q project from a speculative research venture into a **vertically integrated materials and optics powerhouse**. By selling high-value intermediates and \"Green\" industrial components, you generate the non-dilutive capital needed to fund the final 1,000-qubit QPU assembly.\n\n* * *\n\n### **A2Q Series A Revenue Roadmap: Year 1 ($32M Target)**\n\nOur strategy is to \"sell the shovel\" of the quantum era while building the \"gold mine\" (the QPU).\n\n#### **Stream 1: The Isotope Shop ($8.5M)**\n\nBefore we use our purified  $^{12}C$  for our own hardware, we supply the starving research market.\n\n*   **The Product:** High-purity  $^{12}CH_{4}$  (Methane) and  $^{12}C$  Kraft Lignin.\n    \n*   **The Customer:** Quantum diamond NV-center startups, medical MRI labs, and university spin-outs.\n    \n*   **Revenue Model:**  $$" .
