ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_0 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_0 ex:Feature "CNT Density" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_0 ex:Classical_Semiconductor_Lignin_Vitrimer "High.Thousands of bundled CNTs form a \"highway\" (transistor channel) to move current." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_0 ex:Quantum_Chip_Lignin_Vitrimer "Ultra-Low.A single, isolated CNT acts as the qubit. You wantzerocrosstalk." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_1 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_1 ex:Feature "Substrate Goal" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_1 ex:Classical_Semiconductor_Lignin_Vitrimer "Conductivity & Heat.The vitrimer helps dissipate heat from billions of switching operations." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_1 ex:Quantum_Chip_Lignin_Vitrimer "Shielding & Stillness.The vitrimer acts as a \"black hole\" for stray microwave photons (EMI shielding)." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_2 ex:Feature "Gate Role" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_2 ex:Classical_Semiconductor_Lignin_Vitrimer "On/Off Switch.The gate electrode tells the CNT bundle to let electrons through or block them." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_3_Row_2 ex:Quantum_Chip_Lignin_Vitrimer "Phase Shifter.The gate electrode \"nudges\" the single electron's energy to rotate its phase (the fingerprint)." .
