ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Step "I. Localization" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Action "Identify the noisy qubit cluster viaPhase Noise Spectroscopy." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_0 ex:Mechanism "Pinpoints exactly which gates are \"jittering.\"" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_1 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_1 ex:Step "II. Photothermal Pulse" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_1 ex:Action "Apply a focused IR laser pulse to the localLignin-Vitrimermatrix." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_1 ex:Mechanism "Raises the temperature locally above theTopology Freezing Transition Temperature (Tv​)." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_2 ex:Step "III. Bond Shuffling" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_2 ex:Action "The dynamic covalent bonds in the vitrimer \"exchange\" places." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_2 ex:Mechanism "Mechanical stresses are relaxed, and micro-cracks \"weld\" shut at the molecular level." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_3 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_3 ex:Step "IV. Quench & Recalibrate" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_3 ex:Action "Rapidly cool the local area back to base temperature." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_5_Row_3 ex:Mechanism "The CNT is \"re-potted\" in a fresh, stress-free carbon environment." .
