ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_0 ex:Key_Advantage_for_QC "High Kinetic Inductance.Allows for ultra-compact resonators (670–690pH/sq), significantly reducing chip footprint." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_0 ex:Fabrication_Fit "Can be \"seeded\" onto Lignin-Vitrimer or grown as a thin film via CVD." .
