ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_1 ex:Transition_Temp_Tc "< 2 K (doped)" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_1 ex:Key_Advantage_for_QC "Direct-Write Fabrication.Created by lasing a boron-loaded lignin precursor. The electrodes are \"grown\" directly out of the substrate." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_1 ex:Fabrication_Fit "Perfect for the laser-patterning process we've established." .
