ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_2 ex:Transition_Temp_Tc "18 – 38 K" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_2 ex:Key_Advantage_for_QC "HighestTc​for Carbon.Potentially allows for higher temperature operation (300 mK+), simplifying the cryogenic setup." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_11_Row_2 ex:Fabrication_Fit "More complex; requires intercalation of alkali metals (K, Rb, Cs) into the carbon matrix." .
