ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_12_Row_1 ex:Sustainable_B_LIG_Lignin "Low.Focused laser energy (\"Direct-Write\") is extremely energy-efficient and can be done at room temp/pressure." .
