ex:Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_0 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_0 ex:Technical_Risk "N-LIGTc​Consistency" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_0 ex:Impact "LowTc​(< 1K) would require expensive dry-dilution cooling." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_0 ex:Mitigation_Strategy "Laser-Doping Optimization:Use femtosecond pulsed lasers to achieve \"High-Entropy\" doping states, forcing higher Nitrogen concentrations into the lattice to boost the transition temperature." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_1 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_1 ex:Technical_Risk "Vertical Via Reliability" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_1 ex:Impact "Inter-layer connectivity failures in the 3D Star Topology." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_1 ex:Mitigation_Strategy "Vitrimer \"Reflow\" Protocol:Utilize the dynamic covalent bonds of the vitrimer. If a via shows high resistance, a localized photothermal pulse will re-weld the contact at the molecular level without damaging adjacent qubits." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_2 ex:Technical_Risk "Isotopic Leaks" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_2 ex:Impact "Residual13Cin the lignin matrix could cause local magnetic noise." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_2 ex:Mitigation_Strategy "In-Situ Mass Spec:Implement real-time isotope monitoring during the Kraft-pulping and purification phase. Any batch exceeding 0.01%13Cis diverted to classical sensor production." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_3 .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_3 ex:Technical_Risk "CNT Alignment Precision" .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_3 ex:Impact "Misaligned \"spokes\" in the Star Topology causing gate errors." .
ex:Table_Photon_s_Phase_Fingerprint_on_Particles_File_Summary_19_Row_3 ex:Mitigation_Strategy "Self-Aligning Grooves:Use Laser Compression Shock (LCS) to create microscopic channels in the vitrimer that \"guide\" the CNTs into position during the initial ink deposition phase." .
