ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_Proposed_Schedule_0_Row_3 ex:Phase "4. The \"Shake\"(Maintenance)" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_Proposed_Schedule_0_Row_3 ex:Duration "Every 60 sec" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_Proposed_Schedule_0_Row_3 ex:Action_Voltage_Current "Medium Pulse(3x Normal Amps)Duration: ~100ms" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_Proposed_Schedule_0_Row_3 ex:Role_of_Supercapacitor "Partial Discharge" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_Proposed_Schedule_0_Row_3 ex:Physics_Mechanism "Clearing the Double Layer:A quick kick disrupts the ion cloud (diffusion layer) preventing the \"starvation\" that causes tubes to curl or spiral." .
