<< ex:CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_The_Concept ex:the_physics "Carbon Nanotubes anchor to the metal catalyst (Iron) with a bond that is strong in _tension_ (pulling) but weak in _shear_ (sideways vibration)." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
