ex:CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_The_Concept ex:the_action "By vibrating the cathode at high frequency (e.g., 20–40 kHz), you create microscopic shear stress at the root of the forest. The tubes \"snap\" off at the base, leaving the catalyst (Iron) behind on the steel, ready to grow the next batch immediately." .
