ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_0 ex:Zone "Zone 1: The Plasma Airlock" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_0 ex:Action "Pre-Treatment" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_0 ex:Physics "The steel belt enters the reactor through a cold plasma seal. It is stripped of oxides and primed." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_1 ex:Zone "Zone 2: The \"Bast Blast\"" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_1 ex:Action "Nucleation" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_1 ex:Physics "The belt dips into the molten salt.Supercapacitor Pulsefires. 100% density nucleation occurs immediately." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_2 ex:Zone "Zone 3: The Growth Sector" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_2 ex:Action "Elongation" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_2 ex:Physics "The belt moves slowly through the main tank (e.g., a 1-hour transit time). Steady DC current grows the \"Forest.\"" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_3 .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_3 ex:Zone "Zone 4: The Sonic Station" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_3 ex:Action "Harvest" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_3 ex:Physics "As the belt exits the liquid (or just before), anUltrasonic Transducervibrates the belt. The CNT forest delaminates as a solid sheet/mat." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_4 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_4 .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_4 ex:Zone "Zone 5: The Return" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_4 ex:Action "Recycle" .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_7_Row_4 ex:Physics "The bare steel belt loops back to Zone 1. Because the Sonic Razor left the catalyst on the metal, it requires minimal prep to start again." .
