ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Acetone_Ethanol "Extreme Risk.Flash point−20∘C. Vapors are explosive. Requires expensive spark-proof equipment." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Ethyl_Lactate "Safe.Flash point46∘C. Combustible but not highly flammable." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_0 ex:Verdict "Ethyl Lactate wins on safety/CapEx." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
