ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Acetone_Ethanol "High.VOC emissions; inhalation risks." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Ethyl_Lactate "Zero.It is an ester of Lactic Acid (found in soy/corn). It is biodegradable and non-toxic." .
ex:Table_CNT_Cables_2_vs_Copper_Aluminum_Cost_File_Summary_9_Row_1 ex:Verdict "Ethyl Lactate wins on worker safety." .
