ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_The_Sponge_Problem_Hydrophobicity ex:the_physics "If even a few molecules of water get into your gate dielectric, they act as \"traps.\" They will steal electrons, causing the transistor threshold voltage to drift (Hysteresis). Your 1s become 0s." .
