ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_0 ex:The_Issue "Clouds, night, and wind cause temperature fluctuations (1050±50∘C)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_0 ex:The_Reality_Check "CNT chirality is extremely sensitive to temperature. A10∘Cdrop might turn your semiconducting batch into a metallic batch.Fix:YoumustuseMolten Salt Thermal Storage(like concentrated solar power plants) to buffer the heat, or the yield will be near zero." .
