ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_2 ex:The_Issue "Kraft Lignin (industrial waste) contains Sulfur and Ash (minerals)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_2 ex:The_Reality_Check "Even trace Sulfur poisons the semiconductor catalysts and ruins dielectric properties. Refining lignin to \"Electronic Grade\" (99.999%) is expensive.Fix:UseOrganosolv Lignin(extracted with ethanol/water), which is much cleaner than Kraft lignin." .
