ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_3 ex:The_Issue "Getting CNTs to fall into 2nm trenches via fluid flow is statistical." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_1_0_Row_3 ex:The_Reality_Check "You will never get 100% fill. Some trenches will be empty (Dead Transistor), some will have two tubes (Short Circuit).Fix:You must design the logic gates withRedundancy(e.g., use 3 tubes per transistor, so if one is missing, it still works)." .
