ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Part_3 ex:why_they_are_currently_used "Carbon Nanotubes have a specific energy level (Work Function ~4.7–5.0 eV). To get electricity into them without resistance (Ohmic Contact), you need a metal that matches this level. Palladium is the \"perfect match.\"" .
