ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_III_Final_Diagram_v60_0_Row_0 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Input Consolidation.Cellulose is no longer needed for the wrapper; the entire polymer chain comes from the Lignin stream, simplifying Phase 1 chemistry." .
