ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_III_Final_Diagram_v60_0_Row_1 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_0 "RequiresChemical Reactor(grafting) to attach photo-labile groups to Lignin." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_III_Final_Diagram_v60_0_Row_1 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Neutral/Lower Cost.Lignin is often easier to chemically modify than crystalline cellulose, and the extraction is already necessary for the resin." .
