ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_0 ex:Inspection_System "SWIR Imaging" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_0 ex:Failure_Metric "High False Positives/Negatives (Qualitative).SWIR excels at findingstructuraldefects (cracks, micro-bubbles)insidethe substrate (Source 4.2). It struggles withelectricaldefects like small changes in resistance or clustered defects (Source 3.3)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_0 ex:Advantage_of_Combination_v6_0 "The combination allows the factory toisolate the cause of failurein a final diagnostic step (e.g., \"The resistance is high (Electrical Test) because of a void we couldn't optically see (SWIR).\"" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_1 ex:Inspection_System "In-Situ Electrical" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_1 ex:Failure_Metric "Zero False Negatives for Conductivity.Directly measures electrical continuity (6kΩresistance jumps per single defect have been observed, Source 3.1). It cannot detect non-conductivestructuralproblems (e.g., a massive bubble under the contact pad)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Comparable_Failure_Rate_Advantage_0_Row_1 ex:Advantage_of_Combination_v6_0 "Eliminates Functional Defects.The electrical test ensures every printed transistorworks. The SWIR camera is relegated to a separate, less frequentQuality Control (QC) Scanfor long-term reliability (structural defects), rather than being used for real-time trimming." .
