ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Hyperspectral_Imaging_HSI ex:chemical_specificity "CNTs have distinct absorption peaks (known as van Hove singularities) that differ slightly based on their diameter and, critically, their _chirality_ (semiconducting vs. metallic). HSI can detect these minute spectral shifts." .
<< ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_Hyperspectral_Imaging_HSI ex:chemical_specificity "CNTs have distinct absorption peaks (known as van Hove singularities) that differ slightly based on their diameter and, critically, their _chirality_ (semiconducting vs. metallic). HSI can detect these minute spectral shifts." >> ex:confidence 0.8 ;
