ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "Piezotronic Bandgap Tuning" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Strain Control Proof.UseRaman Spectroscopyto measure theG-band shiftin CNTs embedded in a shrinking Lignin matrix." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Core Functional Assumption.Must prove that the Lignin shrinkage is uniform and strong enough to tune the CNT bandgap consistently (controllingVth​)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "LIG Contact Resistance" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Single-Tube Contact Resistance.Measure the electrical resistance between a single CNT and the Laser Induced Graphene (LIG) contact." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_1 ex:Rationale "Electrical Feasibility.Resistance must be<10kΩfor the 2nm transistor to operate at useful speeds." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Phytic Acid Fire Safety" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Thermal Release Test (The Burn Test).Incinerate Lignin coupons containing CNTs and analyze the resulting aerosol withTEM." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_0_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Non-Negotiable Safety.Must prove that the Phytic Acid additive successfully forces the Lignin to form a dense char cage, locking the CNTs out of the respirable air fraction." .
