ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "Adaptive Cleave Performance" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "PCLP Purity & Yield.Prove that the UV laser flash can reliably and cleanly remove thePhoto-Cleavable Lignin Polymer (PCLP)wrapper without leaving residue on the CNT channel across millions of sites." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Eliminating the Stripping Bottleneck.The entire throughput gain of v6.3 relies on this step being fast and clean." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "In-Situ Electrical Metrology Speed" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Data Acquisition Rate.Build a prototype probe card to measure the resistance of a CNT trench array (e.g.,1000sensors in parallel)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_1 ex:Rationale "Throughput Validation.The measurement speed must be faster than the laser pulse rate (i.e., data must be acquired inμstimescales) to successfully guide the trimming/cleaving in real-time." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Holographic Trench Consistency" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Depth/Width Uniformity.UseAFMto verify that theBessel Beamoptics can ablate 2nm trenches with uniform depth and width across the entire, potentially warped, Lignin wafer surface." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_1_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Core Precision.Flawless trenching is essential for guaranteed self-assembly in the next step." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in **General & Business**" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "PCLP Synthesis Consistency" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Bulk Synthesis Scalability.Prove that the chemical process for grafting the photo-cleavable groups onto Lignin can be scaled up to produce industrial volumes of ink precursors with high purity." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Supply Chain Reliability.Inconsistent ink quality will destroy chip yield." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "Hybrid Laser Stability" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Long-Term Output Power.Run theOrganic Dye Lasersystem (switching between solar and electrical pump modes) for 1000+ hours to prove the organic gain medium does not photobleach or degrade rapidly." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_1 ex:Rationale "24/7 Reliability.The factory cannot tolerate laser wavelength drift or power loss when switching modes." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Vitrimer Layer Adhesion" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Layering Stress Test.Demonstrate that the finalTerahertz (THz)scanning reveals no subsurface voids or delamination between the foamed ILD layer and the monolithic substrate after thermal welding." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_General_Business_2_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Final Reliability.Prevents failure from thermal or mechanical stress during the chip's lifetime." .
