ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_0 ex:Risk_Factor "Solar CVD Stability" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_0 ex:Probability "High" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_0 ex:The_Issue "Clouds, night, and wind cause temperature fluctuations (1050±50∘C)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_0 ex:The_Reality_Check "CNT chirality is extremely sensitive to temperature. A10∘Cdrop might turn your semiconducting batch into a metallic batch.Fix:YoumustuseMolten Salt Thermal Storage(like concentrated solar power plants) to buffer the heat, or the yield will be near zero." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 ex:Risk_Factor "Hexyl-Bromide" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 ex:Probability "High" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 ex:The_Issue "Brominated compounds are toxic, ozone-depleting, and heavily regulated." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_1 ex:The_Reality_Check "Using a \"Dirty\" Halogen reaction in a \"Green\" factory defeats the purpose. It creates massive salt waste streams (NaBr).Fix:See Part 2 below." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 ex:Risk_Factor "Lignin Purity" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 ex:Probability "Medium" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 ex:The_Issue "Kraft Lignin (industrial waste) contains Sulfur and Ash (minerals)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_2 ex:The_Reality_Check "Even trace Sulfur poisons the semiconductor catalysts and ruins dielectric properties. Refining lignin to \"Electronic Grade\" (99.999%) is expensive.Fix:UseOrganosolv Lignin(extracted with ethanol/water), which is much cleaner than Kraft lignin." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 ex:Risk_Factor "Trench Alignment" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 ex:Probability "High" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 ex:The_Issue "Getting CNTs to fall into 2nm trenches via fluid flow is statistical." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_23_Row_3 ex:The_Reality_Check "You will never get 100% fill. Some trenches will be empty (Dead Transistor), some will have two tubes (Short Circuit).Fix:You must design the logic gates withRedundancy(e.g., use 3 tubes per transistor, so if one is missing, it still works)." .
