ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_0 ex:Area "Throughput Bottleneck" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_0 ex:v5_5_Status "Sequential Steps.Trench→Trim→Strip→Weld." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_0 ex:v6_0_Improvement "Parallel Photonic Assembly (PPA).Combine Trim and Strip into one patterned cleaving step." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_0 ex:Benefit "Deletes one step.Speeds up the cycle time dramatically." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 ex:Area "Stripping Cost" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 ex:v5_5_Status "Femtosecond Ablation.High energy used to vaporize the Oleate wrapper." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 ex:v6_0_Improvement "Photo-Cleavable Lignin Polymer (PCLP)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_1 ex:Benefit "Energy Reduction.Replaces high-intensity cutting with low-energy UV light (cleaving a specific chemical bond)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 ex:Area "Inspection Redundancy" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 ex:v5_5_Status "CarbonEye SWIR Sensor.Uses extra material and specialized fabrication (Mode B)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 ex:v6_0_Improvement "In-Situ Electrical Metrology." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_35_Row_2 ex:Benefit "Zero-Cost Sensing.Eliminates the need for a separate camera/sensor array." .
