    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 ex:Factor "Input Material" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 ex:Cellulose_Oleate_v5_0 "Cellulose Pulp + Tall Oil Fatty Acids (TOFA)" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_0 "Lignin (Epoxy backbone) + Photo-Labile Groups" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_0 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Input Consolidation.Cellulose is no longer needed for the wrapper; the entire polymer chain comes from the Lignin stream, simplifying Phase 1 chemistry." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 ex:Factor "Synthesis Cost" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 ex:Cellulose_Oleate_v5_0 "RequiresEnzymatic Reactor(∼50∘Cwet chemistry) to perform esterification." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_0 "RequiresChemical Reactor(grafting) to attach photo-labile groups to Lignin." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_1 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Neutral/Lower Cost.Lignin is often easier to chemically modify than crystalline cellulose, and the extraction is already necessary for the resin." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 ex:Factor "Process Cost" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 ex:Cellulose_Oleate_v5_0 "High Ablation Energy.Requires femtosecond laser pulse to vaporize the tough cellulose/oleic polymer." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_0 "Low Cleaving Energy.Requires a brief, low-power UV flash to cleave the chemical bond." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_2 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Significant OpEx Reduction.The energy per chip for the \"strip\" step drops by orders of magnitude, boosting throughput." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 ex:Factor "Waste" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 ex:Cellulose_Oleate_v5_0 "Produces volatile hydrocarbons (vaporized Oleate)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_0 "Produces photo-cleaved fragments (which are clean, small molecules that are easily desorbed)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_36_Row_3 ex:Impact_on_Cost_Input "Cleaner Process.Reduces the workload on the exhaust/filtration system." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_0 ex:Metric "Feasibility" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_0 ex:In_Situ_Electrical_Test_v6_0 "High.Techniques exist to monitor resistance change in real-time on CNTs. Electrodes can be definedbeforethe CNT deposition." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_0 ex:SWIR_Imaging_v5_0 "High.SWIR is a standard semiconductor inspection tool (Source 4.1)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_1 ex:Metric "Speed" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_1 ex:In_Situ_Electrical_Test_v6_0 "Faster (Microsecond Scale).Current can be measured instantly across the die. The limit is the speed of the multiplexer/ADC, not imaging frame rate." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_1 ex:SWIR_Imaging_v5_0 "Slower (Millisecond Scale).Limited by camera frame rate (e.g., 60-120 fps for area scan), exposure time, and image processing algorithms (Source 3.5, 4.5)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_2 ex:Metric "Data Type" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_2 ex:In_Situ_Electrical_Test_v6_0 "Direct Electrical Data (Ω).Directly measures the device function (conductivity)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_37_Row_2 ex:SWIR_Imaging_v5_0 "Indirect Optical Data (Intensity).Measures reflected or emitted light, requiring algorithms to infer defects (Source 4.4)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_0 ex:Inspection_System "SWIR Imaging" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_0 ex:Failure_Metric "High False Positives/Negatives (Qualitative).SWIR excels at findingstructuraldefects (cracks, micro-bubbles)insidethe substrate (Source 4.2). It struggles withelectricaldefects like small changes in resistance or clustered defects (Source 3.3)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_0 ex:Advantage_of_Combination_v6_0 "The combination allows the factory toisolate the cause of failurein a final diagnostic step (e.g., \"The resistance is high (Electrical Test) because of a void we couldn't optically see (SWIR).\"" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_1 ex:Inspection_System "In-Situ Electrical" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_1 ex:Failure_Metric "Zero False Negatives for Conductivity.Directly measures electrical continuity (6kΩresistance jumps per single defect have been observed, Source 3.1). It cannot detect non-conductivestructuralproblems (e.g., a massive bubble under the contact pad)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_38_Row_1 ex:Advantage_of_Combination_v6_0 "Eliminates Functional Defects.The electrical test ensures every printed transistorworks. The SWIR camera is relegated to a separate, less frequentQuality Control (QC) Scanfor long-term reliability (structural defects), rather than being used for real-time trimming." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 ex:Feature "Cost (Input)" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "Medium.Requires Cellulose Pulp + Tall Oil Fatty Acids + Enzyme Catalyst." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Low.Requires Lignin (Waste) + Nitrobenzyl Chloride (chemical modifier)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_0 ex:Winner "PCLP" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 ex:Feature "Synthesis" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "Bio-Chemo.Enzymatic esterification is slow but mild (50∘C)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Chemical.Grafting is a faster bulk chemical reaction but requires strict pH control." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_1 ex:Winner "Tie" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 ex:Feature "Removal Energy" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "High.Requires Femtosecond Laser Ablation (high heat) to vaporize the wrapper." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Ultra-Low.Requires a low-power UV LED flash to snap the bonds." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_2 ex:Winner "PCLP" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 ex:Feature "Residue Risk" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "High.Vaporizing plastic leaves \"carbon soot\" (trash) on the channel." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Low.The cleaved fragments are designed to be small and volatile, desorbing cleanly." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_3 ex:Winner "PCLP" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 ex:Feature "Stability (UV)" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "Excellent.Stable in sunlight; requires intense heat to break." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Poor.Inherently unstablein UV light (see below)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_4 ex:Winner "Hexyl-Cellulose" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 ex:Feature "Sustainability" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 ex:Hexyl_Cellulose_v5_0 "Good.100% Bio-based (Wood + Tall Oil)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 ex:Photo_Cleavable_Lignin_PCLP_v6_1 "Mixed.Lignin is bio-based, but the photo-labile group (Nitrobenzyl) is currently synthetic." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_39_Row_5 ex:Winner "Hexyl-Cellulose" .
