ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "Piezotronic Bandgap Tuning" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Strain Control Proof.UseRaman Spectroscopyto measure theG-band shiftin CNTs embedded in a shrinking Lignin matrix." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Core Functional Assumption.Must prove that the Lignin shrinkage is uniform and strong enough to tune the CNT bandgap consistently (controllingVth​)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "LIG Contact Resistance" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Single-Tube Contact Resistance.Measure the electrical resistance between a single CNT and the Laser Induced Graphene (LIG) contact." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_1 ex:Rationale "Electrical Feasibility.Resistance must be<10kΩfor the 2nm transistor to operate at useful speeds." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Phytic Acid Fire Safety" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Thermal Release Test (The Burn Test).Incinerate Lignin coupons containing CNTs and analyze the resulting aerosol withTEM." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_43_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Non-Negotiable Safety.Must prove that the Phytic Acid additive successfully forces the Lignin to form a dense char cage, locking the CNTs out of the respirable air fraction." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
ex:CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary ex:hasDataTable ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_0 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "Adaptive Cleave Performance" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "PCLP Purity & Yield.Prove that the UV laser flash can reliably and cleanly remove thePhoto-Cleavable Lignin Polymer (PCLP)wrapper without leaving residue on the CNT channel across millions of sites." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Eliminating the Stripping Bottleneck.The entire throughput gain of v6.3 relies on this step being fast and clean." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "In-Situ Electrical Metrology Speed" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Data Acquisition Rate.Build a prototype probe card to measure the resistance of a CNT trench array (e.g.,1000sensors in parallel)." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_1 ex:Rationale "Throughput Validation.The measurement speed must be faster than the laser pulse rate (i.e., data must be acquired inμstimescales) to successfully guide the trimming/cleaving in real-time." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Holographic Trench Consistency" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Depth/Width Uniformity.UseAFMto verify that theBessel Beamoptics can ablate 2nm trenches with uniform depth and width across the entire, potentially warped, Lignin wafer surface." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_44_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Core Precision.Flawless trenching is essential for guaranteed self-assembly in the next step." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45 a ex:DataTable ;
    rdfs:label "Data Table in File Summary" .
