ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_0 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_0 ex:Process_Component "PCLP Synthesis Consistency" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_0 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Bulk Synthesis Scalability.Prove that the chemical process for grafting the photo-cleavable groups onto Lignin can be scaled up to produce industrial volumes of ink precursors with high purity." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_0 ex:Rationale "Supply Chain Reliability.Inconsistent ink quality will destroy chip yield." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_1 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_1 ex:Process_Component "Hybrid Laser Stability" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_1 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Long-Term Output Power.Run theOrganic Dye Lasersystem (switching between solar and electrical pump modes) for 1000+ hours to prove the organic gain medium does not photobleach or degrade rapidly." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_1 ex:Rationale "24/7 Reliability.The factory cannot tolerate laser wavelength drift or power loss when switching modes." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45 ex:hasRow ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_2 .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_2 ex:Process_Component "Vitrimer Layer Adhesion" .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_2 ex:R_D_Proof_Required "Layering Stress Test.Demonstrate that the finalTerahertz (THz)scanning reveals no subsurface voids or delamination between the foamed ILD layer and the monolithic substrate after thermal welding." .
ex:Table_CNT_Bandgap_Creation_with_Lignin_Vitrimer_File_Summary_45_Row_2 ex:Rationale "Final Reliability.Prevents failure from thermal or mechanical stress during the chip's lifetime." .
