ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_0 ex:Biorefinery_Feedstock_Waste_Stream "Rice Straw/Husk Ash" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_0 ex:Synergy_Function "The ash residue from burning rice husks contains high concentrations of amorphoussilica (SiO2​). This can be mixed with theCarbon Charfrom the solar pyrolysis and heated to1,500∘C+ to create high-performanceSiCceramics." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
