ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_1 ex:Biorefinery_Feedstock_Waste_Stream "Lignin" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_1 ex:Synergy_Function "Lignin is a binding agent. It can be mixed with ceramic powders (likeAl2​O3​orZrO2​) and then pyrolyzed. The lignin burns out, leaving behind highly porous, high-strengthceramic scaffolds(ideal for lightweight structural components or advanced filters)." .
