ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_2 ex:Component_Produced "High-Purity Silica" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_2 ex:Biorefinery_Feedstock_Waste_Stream "CNF Waste Water" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Corrosion_and_Stability_0_Row_2 ex:Synergy_Function "The process used to extract Nanocellulose often leaves behind silica rich water. This can be harvested and calcinated in the high-heat zone to produce high-puritysilica fillerfor ceramic composites." .
