ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Lubricant_Additives_1_Row_0 ex:Base_Oil_CNT_GO "Faintly Fruity/Sweet.Esters often have a pleasant, mild aroma (like fruits or flowers). It would lack the characteristic woody scent of the raw sulfonated lignin." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Lubricant_Additives_1_Row_0 ex:Comparison_toH2_O_PG_Fluid "H2​O/PG has a woody, medicinal smell." .
