ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Lubricant_Additives_1_Row_1 ex:Base_Oil_CNT_GO "Very Low.Synthetic esters are biodegradable and have minimal oral toxicity. The fluid is non-aqueous and non-glycol, removing the primary ingestion hazard." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_Lubricant_Additives_1_Row_1 ex:Comparison_toH2_O_PG_Fluid "Solves the high ingestion toxicity problem of Ethylene Glycol and Bio-PG (to a lesser degree)." .
