ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_14_Row_1 ex:Bio_Ethylene_Glycol_Bio_EG "Higher(Lower viscosity, higher heat capacity)" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_14_Row_1 ex:Bio_Propylene_Glycol_Bio_PG "Lower(Higher viscosity, slightly lower heat capacity)" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_14_Row_1 ex:Relevance_to_Heat_Pumps "Performance:EG transfers heat slightly better, but the difference is marginal for most residential systems." .
