ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_14_Row_2 ex:Bio_Propylene_Glycol_Bio_PG "Higher(Requires slightly more pump energy)" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_14_Row_2 ex:Relevance_to_Heat_Pumps "Pump Energy:PG requires a slightly stronger pump or larger piping, increasing OPEX slightly." .
