ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_20_Row_1 ex:Problem_Solved "Trade-off:Traditional aerogels are fragile. Cellulose aerogels are significantly tougher, and the post-treatment (e.g., Sodium Hydroxide/Dipping) allows them to exceed the mechanical strength of common 3D-printed plastics like PLA and ABS." .
