ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_0 ex:Feature "Smell" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_0 ex:Base_Oil_CNT_GO "Faintly Fruity/Sweet.Esters often have a pleasant, mild aroma (like fruits or flowers). It would lack the characteristic woody scent of the raw sulfonated lignin." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_0 ex:Comparison_toH2_O_PG_Fluid "H2​O/PG has a woody, medicinal smell." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_1 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_1 .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_1 ex:Feature "Toxicity" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_1 ex:Base_Oil_CNT_GO "Very Low.Synthetic esters are biodegradable and have minimal oral toxicity. The fluid is non-aqueous and non-glycol, removing the primary ingestion hazard." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_1 ex:Comparison_toH2_O_PG_Fluid "Solves the high ingestion toxicity problem of Ethylene Glycol and Bio-PG (to a lesser degree)." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_2 a ex:TableRow .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24 ex:hasRow ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_2 .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_2 ex:Feature "Fouling" .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_2 ex:Base_Oil_CNT_GO "Low foaming, excellent compatibility with seals." .
ex:Table_Carbon_Chips_Hurdles_and_Future_File_Summary_24_Row_2 ex:Comparison_toH2_O_PG_Fluid "High foaming risk, low compatibility with some older seals." .
